{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03740","headline":"送骆奉礼从军 · 李峤","name":"送骆奉礼从军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉塞边烽举，金坛庙略申。\n羽书资锐笔，戎幕引英宾。\n剑动三军气，衣飘万里尘。\n琴尊留别赏，风景惜离晨。\n笛梅含晚吹，营柳带余春。\n希君勒石返，歌舞入城闉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}